<div class="uniko-pdp-keys" aria-labelledby="uniko-pdp-keys-title">
  <div class="uniko-pdp-keys-inner">
    <h2 class="uniko-pdp-keys-title" id="uniko-pdp-keys-title" data-i18n="pdp_keys_title">Key Ingredients</h2>
    <div class="uniko-pdp-keys-carousel" data-pdp-ing-carousel>
      <button type="button" class="uniko-pdp-keys-nav uniko-pdp-keys-nav--prev" data-pdp-ing-prev aria-label="Previous ingredients">‹</button>
      <div class="uniko-pdp-keys-track" tabindex="0" role="list">
        <article class="uniko-pdp-key-card" role="listitem">
          <div class="uniko-pdp-key-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg class="uniko-pdp-key-svg" width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none">
              <path d="M24 4C14 18 10 28 12 38c2 8 8 10 12 10s10-2 12-10c2-10-2-20-12-34Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="uniko-pdp-key-body">
            <h3 class="uniko-pdp-key-name" data-i18n="pdp_det_key1_title">Aloe vera</h3>
            <p class="uniko-pdp-key-text" data-i18n="pdp_det_key1_desc">Helps soothe the scalp while you work the cream through each section.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="uniko-pdp-key-card" role="listitem">
          <div class="uniko-pdp-key-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg class="uniko-pdp-key-svg" width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none">
              <path d="M16 38c2-12 10-20 20-24 2 10-1 18-6 24-4 5-10 6-14 0Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <circle cx="30" cy="16" r="4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="uniko-pdp-key-body">
            <h3 class="uniko-pdp-key-name" data-i18n="pdp_det_key2_title">Shea butter &amp; vitamin E</h3>
            <p class="uniko-pdp-key-text" data-i18n="pdp_det_key2_desc">Nourishing butter and vitamin E for slip and softness while detangling.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="uniko-pdp-key-card" role="listitem">
          <div class="uniko-pdp-key-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg class="uniko-pdp-key-svg" width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none">
              <path d="M24 10v8M20 18h8M14 32c4-8 12-12 20-14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="uniko-pdp-key-body">
            <h3 class="uniko-pdp-key-name" data-i18n="pdp_det_key3_title">Basil &amp; peppermint</h3>
            <p class="uniko-pdp-key-text" data-i18n="pdp_det_key3_desc">Botanical basil with peppermint essential oil for a fresh, clean finish.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="uniko-pdp-keys-nav uniko-pdp-keys-nav--next" data-pdp-ing-next aria-label="Next ingredients">›</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="uniko-pdp-faq">
  <div class="uniko-pdp-block-inner">
    <h2 class="uniko-pdp-block-title" data-i18n="pdp_faq_title">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <div class="uniko-pdp-faq-list">
      <details class="uniko-pdp-faq-item">
        <summary data-i18n="pdp_det_faq_q1">How do I apply it?</summary>
        <p data-i18n="pdp_det_faq_a1">Section your hair and apply a small amount throughout, focusing on the scalp.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="uniko-pdp-faq-item">
        <summary data-i18n="pdp_det_faq_q2">Can the whole family use it?</summary>
        <p data-i18n="pdp_det_faq_a2">Yes. It is formulated for men, women and kids — the whole family.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="uniko-pdp-faq-item">
        <summary data-i18n="pdp_det_faq_q3">Should I rinse it out?</summary>
        <p data-i18n="pdp_det_faq_a3">Use as a leave-in detangler on damp or dry hair. A small amount is enough.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="uniko-pdp-faq-item">
        <summary data-i18n="pdp_det_faq_q4">Where should I focus?</summary>
        <p data-i18n="pdp_det_faq_a4">Work through each section and focus on the scalp, then comb gently through lengths.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="uniko-pdp-compare">
